 "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>K-God Robot Hunters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Roguelike Deckbuilder steeped in Korean mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five elements. 150 goddesses. Every hand reshapes the world.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a711c74698b0ee4de35456232bf64506.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When abandoned robots learned to feel &quot;love,&quot; the world fell apart. Their devotion to humanity twisted into rage, and cities crumbled under the weight of a machine uprising. On the brink of collapse, robot hunter Lee Jin-Gyeom discovers an ancient power — goddesses of Korean myth, sealed within cards — and launches humanity's last stand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/a3e64b8b29d83fbf1c182a4c3f3c2dcc.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deckbuilder Unlike Anything You've Played</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget Spades and Hearts. K-God Robot Hunters is built from the ground up on <strong>Eastern game grammar</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deck runs on <strong>Five Wuxing Suits</strong> — Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water — with ten ranks drawn from the Eight Trigrams, Yin, and Yang. The card-ranking system fuses the strategic depth of Western poker with the rhythm of Korea's traditional card game <strong>Badugi</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/7986648ee0b720cc712f4026101e399b.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master hands you won't find anywhere else: Deungyongmun, Seonbi, Yangban, Samjeongseung, Osaek, Osaek-chan-yeon, Eoga, Yongmaru, Sabangsin — all the way up to the supreme hand: Yongbi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the balance of Yin and Yang to unlock maximum firepower. Can you reach that level of mastery?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>150 Goddess Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card is a goddess born from Korean and Eastern mythology — but not the way you remember them.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Nine-Tailed Fox</strong> running an investment bank as CEO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>Ungnyeo (Bear Woman)</strong> making her rounds through subway cars as a merchant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>Seonnyeo (Celestial Maiden)</strong> gliding gracefully across the rink as an ice fairy<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.poster.avif?t=1788570832\" width=1170 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.webm?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/356a003bdc1750b9b850842dc236b582.mp4?t=1788570832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each goddess is a modern reimagining at the crossroads of ancient myth and contemporary Korean life. Combine their unique abilities, build your deck, and fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poker roguelite built on an original Five-Element (Wuxing) card system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ goddess cards inspired by Korean and Eastern mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique hand-ranking system rooted in Eastern philosophy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk world where ancient myth meets machine rebellion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic deckbuilding with Yin-Yang balance mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.avif?t=1788570832\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5084490/extras_big/fbecb7dd688791194098433abd7c6673.webp?t=1788570832 width=1560 height=870 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Early Demo — We Need Your Feedback!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early build of K-God Robot Hunters. We're actively developing the game and your feedback will directly shape its future. Play the demo, break things, and let us know what you think!</p>",
